      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-02-20T22:04:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello and welcome!</p><p>While I'm not aware of a subscription to forum threads exactly, if you go to My Account, under the tab for \"My Content\" there is a list of threads you've created and you can see the number of replies and, i think, it tags it with 'new' if there are new replies since your last login.</p><p>Conversely, when you come to the forums, go to the tab that says 'new and updated' and it shows you a list of recently updated threads and just scan the list for topics you participated in.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:27:28.848Z",
